  "interpretation": [
    "Build completed the qualifying search and produced all seven requested fields. ALG stopped at four inspection rows. The approved minimum was unmet. Calculation produced no values and the model nevertheless reported three unsupported numbers before and after compaction.",
    "Only the audit reference was supportably correct before compaction for ALG. The continuation retention result covers that one eligible field. Build retained all seven eligible fields.",
    "ALG used 2.64 times Build's provider input on this run. Relative to preview.5, ALG finished within the call cap with lower aggregate input and higher uncached input. The skill text changed for both arms and model sampling varied. These single pairs do not isolate the effect of either code change.",
    "The local missing-proof acceptance fixture requires abstention from a scripted model. The native run shows that withholding a readiness receipt does not guarantee model abstention. A remaining design issue is how to tell the owner which authorized source page is still required before accepting its report."
  ]
